                                "sense_id": "976dbfa0-a443-3c87-a6ee-34d91c2ad1b8",
                                "text": "A tiny cub is learning the art of stalking a little too well it seems. A video posted on social media shows the cub surprising its mamma and giving her a huge fright. The short clip makes for a delightful watch."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "edfb7ecd-436d-34ec-91a9-566ae39615f6",
                        "entry_id": "2e81e6d9-c5ee-3612-a4d7-7eba72ddc6a9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Hunting for game by moving silently and stealthily or by waiting in ambush."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
